<title>USA: Solectron completes FORCE acquisition.</title>
<headline>Solectron completes FORCE acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solectron Corp and FORCE COMPUTERS Inc said Tuesday they had completed their planned merger.</p>
<p>The merger was completed via a pooling-of-interests for about $205 million or some 3.5 million shares of Solectron stock.</p>
<p>FORCE is a provider of control and communications applications.</p>
<p>The merger is hoped to give Solectron greater capabilities to support global growth by expanding outsourcing services. FORCE will become a wholly owned subsidiary of Solectron and will continue to operate under its own name and maintain its headquarters in San Jose.</p>
</text>
